Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,H_id,,0,0,0,,"Aku punya SISTEM." Belum ada yang percaya...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.99,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku punya SISTEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.00,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sistem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.62,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sistem militer rahasia buatan luar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.74,S_id,,0,0,0,,atau sistem buatanmu sendiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.68,S_id,,0,0,0,,yang incaran negara asing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.62,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:08.56,S_id,,0,0,0,,SISTEM beneran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:09.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kayak di novel web —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.86,S_id,,0,0,0,,absen dapat mobil mewah dan rumah mewah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.80,S_id,,0,0,0,,poin skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.46,S_id,,0,0,0,,yang mengubahmu jadi manusia super.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:17.08,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kalian tertawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.92,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku terlatih secara profesional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.36,S_id,,0,0,0,,Seberapa lucu pun, aku tak akan tertawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:22.86,S_id,,0,0,0,,Jadi maksudmu adalah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.84,S_id,,0,0,0,,kamu punya sistem seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:24.78,S_id,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.72,S_id,,0,0,0,,Itu muncul tiba-tiba bulan lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.72,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tapi sepertinya banyak bugnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:27.84,S_id,,0,0,0,,Banyak teksnya rusak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,Misi yang dikasih aneh-aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.00,S_id,,0,0,0,,Misi selesai dapat aneka hadiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.20,S_id,,0,0,0,,Beberapa awal memperkuat tubuhku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku tak bisa membuktikannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:34.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kalau gagal misi bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.18,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kalau gagal...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.56,S_id,,0,0,0,,dia bunuh aku dan seluruh keluargaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.49,S_id,,0,0,0,,Waham dicekoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:40.43,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sudahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.30,S_id,,0,0,0,,Biarkan dia tenang dulu.
